        "content": "## Invoice due soon reminder (before it is late)\nEmails your client a polite heads-up 3 days before an invoice is due.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4d75923b-311f-51d8-9f3c-a257d520685f",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
